  "body": "While retrieving the origin with the attribute getter, no step in the specification(s) says to serialize the host (as it does when executing the host attribute getter). I think that should actually be specified in the [origin section](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-origin).\n\nThis leads to the domain-to-unicode algorithm receiving an IPv4 address directly as a 32bit identifier (which doesn't handle that case either).\n",
